<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian FSB bank boosts half-yr profits.</title>
<headline>Nigerian FSB bank boosts half-yr profits.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year profit for FSB International Bank to end-September. (In million naira)</p>
<p>				    1996	1995</p>
<p>Gross earnings		  576.4     297.6</p>
<p>Profit before taxation	239.8     105.1</p>
<p>Taxation			   71.9	38.8</p>
<p>Profit after taxation	 167.9	66.2</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>--Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
